  "ANATOMICAL leg only: wiring geometry, NOT an operating point (L164).",
  "Operator powers are walks WITH revisits, not paths; pool cells are themselves reachable so deeper arrivals include recurrent mass.",
  "r_d = A^d 1 is source-FREE (summed over all sources) \u2014 it is the depth-d generalisation of in-mass, not a per-actor reach.",
